          "message": "The oversized-input tests do not verify the required retryable failure behavior.",
          "confidence": 0.97,
          "category": "other",
          "evidence": {
            "codePathTraced": "The over-limit document, package, and page tests assert rejection, but none checks EvidenceFailure.Retryable.",
            "failureScenario": "If an oversized PDF failure is changed to Retryable=false, these tests still pass. The acceptance criteria require oversized PDFs to fail visibly and retryably."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
